re .mjs files!). Wait: canary overlay files are under `test/characterization/canary/...` — not in the v0.1 copy dir, so no unregistered error. Good.\n\nNow: does `check-frozen-files` care about `test/characterization/canary/**`? No.\n\nNow let me double check hashing stable.test.mjs: it's registered; if I later edit it, must regenerate hash. Order: write stable.test.mjs last-ish, then compute hashes for frozen-files.json.\n\nAlso note: `contracts/golden/**` doesn't exist → no entries.\n\nNow the defects.json order: exactly as table:\na1-quota, a2-pack, a3-runner, a4-paths, a4-null-config, a5-dup-call, a5-forecast-x3, a5-unused, a5-ignored-fields, a5-shell, a5-nocache.\n\nNow, repro_sha256 for a3-runner computed from T-001's file (read-only, don't modify).\n\nNow impl.md — a new file at repo root? The task says 产出 impl.md. Where? Likely `.collab/tasks/002/impl.md`. The brief says \"完成后在 impl.md 里说明\". E-2 permits `.collab/tasks/002/` files. I'll write `C:\\git\\dsh-CLIWorker\\.collab\\worktrees\\002\\.collab\\tasks\\002\\impl.md`.\n\nNow let me check Node version and test the tap output format quickly.\n\nAlso need to check `test/unit/select.test.mjs` to ensure no conflict with my fixture paths. Not needed.\n\nOne more: `check-test-discovery.mjs` may check test discovery/orphans. Our canary files are .mjs but not .test.mjs → excluded from discovery? `findOrphans` walks test/characterization recursively for `*.test.mjs` only. Fine.\n\nLet me check check-ci.mjs / ci-matrix to see if anything enumerates scripts or files.\n\nLet me now check node version and run existing checks baseline.","signature":""}],"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b6e5ba867444bd771672006700a3","_messageId":"0