{"type":"assistant","uuid":"01a1b6ea-8713-7a41-a13c-d8bacad4419a","session_id":"01a1b6e5-b62d-77fa-b8d6-e09057b99f7b","message":{"id":"01a1b6ea87137a41a13cd8b813e8ebda","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Wait, test 15: the repro file is `MINI_REPRO` which uses `assert.equal(mod.BROKEN, true)` — my edit's find string is exactly `assert.equal(mod.BROKEN, true)`, appearing once. After replacement → `assert.equal(mod.BROKEN,` → wait, the replacement removes ` true)` so the line becomes `  assert.equal(mod.BROKEN,` then newline then `})`. That's a syntax error → cannot load. Good.\n\nHmm: but the block's last line is `})`; the broken line is `assert.equal(mod.BROKEN,` and then `})`. Syntax error at parse time. Good.\n\nAlso test 8: `manifestRoot(files, registeredFrom(files, [{path: `${COPY}lib/forecast.mjs`, ...}]))` — `registeredFrom` already includes all files. But wait, I also passed `{ path: STABLE, ...}` in test 7 — duplicate path! `registeredFrom(files)` includes STABLE already, then extra adds STABLE again → manifest_schema duplicate error. Bug in test 7. Let me fix: remove that extra.\n\nActually in test 7 I wrote:\n```js\nconst root = manifestRoot(files, registeredFrom(files, [{ path: STABLE, sha256: digest(files[STABLE]) }]))\n```\nThat's a duplicate of STABLE → duplicate path error. Fix by removing the extra.\n\nAlso test 9: registered includes `lib\\select.mjs` and `C:/tmp/outside.json` — fine.\n\nLet me fix test 7.\n\nAlso check: test 15's `defectRoot` with overlay: null and edits — the canary has only repro_edits → allowed.\n\nAnother concern: in test 12 (always repro), `defectRoot` default overlay is `export const BROKEN = false` → canary run copies it, repro is tautology → passes → canary_survived. Good.\n\nTest 14: copy BROKEN=false, overlay default BROKEN=false → baseline fails → baseline_failed. Good (canary not run).\n\nFix test 7 now.","signature":""}],"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b6e5ba867444bd771672006700a3","_messageId":"01a1b6ea87137a41a13cd8b813e8ebda","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a1b6e5ba867444bd771672006700a3","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a1b6ea87137a41a13cd8b813e8ebda","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a1b6ea87137a41a13cd8b813e8ebda","codebuddy.ai/messageId":"01a1b6ea-8713-7a41-a13c-d8bacad4419a","traceparent":"00-4a75c094774db18b4fa9b0e599d0db42-f8dbe608f8e504b0-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a1b6e5-b62d-77fa-b8d6-e09057b99f7b,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a1b6e5ba867444bd771672006700a3"},"__timestamp":"2026-11-07T16:49:50.785Z"}
